            "summary" : "FLUX 3 Image Klein text-to-image (Black Forest Labs, 5.55B flow-map DiT on Qwen3-VL-4B; 16 steps, no guidance): strong English text rendering, bounding-box layout in the prompt. Write a FULL SCENE CAPTION, not a short request: medium and style, the scene, lighting and camera, and every subject with its colours, materials and place in the frame. Put any text to render in quotes. A short prompt gives generic output. For layout, append a JSON list of boxes after the caption: [{\"id\": \"name_1\", \"bbox\": [top, left, bottom, right] on a 0–1000 grid, \"desc\": \"…\"}], and tag each element in the caption as <name_1>. BFL's prompt upsampler system prompts: huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-pup (system_prompts.json). FLUX KOMMUNITY LICENCE: non-commercial, or commercial outputs only for businesses under US$5M revenue that filter content and disclose AI generation; never train on outputs.",
