            "summary" : "FLUX 3 Image Klein editing and composition with up to 10 reference images. One reference keeps its own size, fitted under 4.19 MP (2048²); several are each fitted under 1 MP. Write the caption as a complete description of the result, the edit folded in. Refer to the n-th reference as 'the n-th image', or as <ref_image_n> in box edits. Write a FULL SCENE CAPTION, not a short request: medium and style, the scene, lighting and camera, and every subject with its colours, materials and place in the frame. Put any text to render in quotes. A short prompt gives generic output. For layout, append a JSON list of boxes after the caption: [{\"id\": \"name_1\", \"bbox\": [top, left, bottom, right] on a 0–1000 grid, \"desc\": \"…\"}], and tag each element in the caption as <name_1>. BFL's prompt upsampler system prompts: huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-pup (system_prompts.json). FLUX KOMMUNITY LICENCE (see text-to-image).",
